		aliases = { "Mellivora capensis", "Ratel" },
		summary = "The **honey badger** (**Mellivora capensis**), also known as the **ratel** ( or ), is a [[Mammal|mammal]] widely distributed across [[Africa]], Southwest Asia, and the Indian subcontinent. It is the sole living representative of the Mellivorinae subfamily of the [[Mustelidae]].",
